msgstr "Veld vir mandjienaam: "

#: koha-tmpl/intranet-tmpl/prog/en/modules/admin/marc_order_accounts.tt:140
#, c-format
msgid "(Optional): If you want the basket name to be dynamic based on a value in the MARC file, you can set a field here that will be read on import and used for the basket name."
msgstr "(Opsioneel): Indien u wil hê die mandjienaam moet dinamies wees op grond van 'n waarde in die MARC-lêer, kan u hier 'n veld stel wat met invoer gelees en vir die mandjienaam gebruik word."

#: koha-tmpl/intranet-tmpl/prog/en/modules/admin/marc_order_accounts.tt:142
#, c-format
msgid "The first record in the file must be the record to contain this field, others will be ignored. If a value is not found the filename will be used for the basket name."
